    "verdict_notes": "Rows r1, r4, r8, r10, r12 and r14 are baseline reference points, which is acceptable. The test set has 110 questions with author-only human evaluation and no uncertainty reported, so differences of 1-4 questions are within noise. Most comparisons mix fine-tunes, quantization and creators, so they are not controlled scaling tests. LLaMA 65B (0%) is correctly excluded."
